https://github.com/databendlabs/databend/issues/20612  confirmed

DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS repro_databend916_db8_min;
CREATE DATABASE repro_databend916_db8_min;
USE repro_databend916_db8_min;

SET enable_query_result_cache = 0;

-- 单表基准，MEMORY 引擎。
CREATE TABLE vp_source (
    vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL
) ENGINE = MEMORY;

INSERT INTO vp_source VALUES (1), (2), (3), (4);

-- 纵向分区左表。分三次 INSERT 是触发条件：
-- 形成 [1,4]、[2]、[3] 三个 FUSE block。
CREATE TABLE vp_left (
    vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL
) ENGINE = FUSE;

INSERT INTO vp_left VALUES (1), (4);
INSERT INTO vp_left VALUES (2);
INSERT INTO vp_left VALUES (3);

-- 纵向分区右表。
CREATE TABLE vp_right (
    vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL
) ENGINE = FUSE;

INSERT INTO vp_right
SELECT vp_rowid FROM vp_source;

-- 保留原日志的 TEMP_TABLE + 多表 JOIN 重建结构。
CREATE TEMPORARY TABLE vp_joined (
    vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL
);

INSERT INTO vp_joined
SELECT l.vp_rowid
FROM vp_left AS l
JOIN vp_right AS r
  ON l.vp_rowid = r.vp_rowid;

-- 单表基准查询。
SELECT vp_rowid
FROM vp_source
ORDER BY vp_rowid
LIMIT 3;

-- 多表重建并物化后的查询。
SELECT vp_rowid
FROM vp_joined
ORDER BY vp_rowid
LIMIT 3;

EXPLAIN
SELECT vp_rowid
FROM vp_source
ORDER BY vp_rowid
LIMIT 3;

EXPLAIN
SELECT vp_rowid
FROM vp_joined
ORDER BY vp_rowid
LIMIT 3;

单表基准结果正确：
+----------+
| vp_rowid |
+----------+
|        1 |
|        2 |
|        3 |
+----------+
多表重建结果错误：
+----------+
| vp_rowid |
+----------+
|        1 |
|        2 |
|        4 |
+----------+

单表查询执行计划
Limit
├── output columns: [vp_source.vp_rowid (#0)]
├── limit: 3
├── offset: 0
├── estimated rows: 3.00
└── Sort(Single)
    ├── output columns: [vp_source.vp_rowid (#0)]
    ├── sort keys: [vp_rowid ASC NULLS LAST]
    ├── estimated rows: 4.00
    └── TableScan
        ├── table: default.repro_databend916_db8_min.vp_source
        ├── scan id: 0
        ├── output columns: [vp_rowid (#0)]
        ├── read rows: 4
        ├── read size: < 1 KiB
        ├── partitions total: 0
        ├── partitions scanned: 0
        ├── push downs: [filters: [], limit: 3]
        └── estimated rows: 4.00
MEMORY 表完整读取 4 行，再排序并取前 3 行，因此得到 1,2,3。
重建表查询执行计划
Limit
├── output columns: [vp_joined.vp_rowid (#0)]
├── limit: 3
├── offset: 0
├── estimated rows: 3.00
└── Sort(Single)
    ├── output columns: [vp_joined.vp_rowid (#0)]
    ├── sort keys: [vp_rowid ASC NULLS LAST]
    ├── estimated rows: 4.00
    └── TableScan
        ├── table: default.repro_databend916_db8_min.vp_joined
        ├── scan id: 0
        ├── output columns: [vp_rowid (#0)]
        ├── read rows: 3
        ├── read size: < 1 KiB
        ├── partitions total: 3
        ├── partitions scanned: 2
        ├── pruning stats:
        │   segments:
        │     range pruning: 1 to 1
        │   blocks:
        │     range pruning: 3 to 3
        │     topn pruning: 3 to 2
        ├── push downs: [filters: [], limit: 3]
        └── estimated rows: 4.00
关键差异是：
partitions total: 3
partitions scanned: 2
topn pruning: 3 to 2
read rows: 3
临时 FUSE 表的三个 block 是：
block 1: [1, 4]
block 2: [2]
block 3: [3]
Top-N pruning 错误地认为读取前两个候选 block 已足够满足 LIMIT 3，从而剪掉包含 3 的第三个 block。之后排序只能对已读取的 1,4,2 排序，最终得到：
1, 2, 4
Top-N 块剪枝在块内无序、块间范围交错时使用了不安全的剪枝条件。
Databend FUSE 表在 ORDER BY ... LIMIT 场景下 Top-N 块剪枝错误 导致漏读数据